<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's raised due to price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's raised due to price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards said it upgraded Lowe's Cos Inc to buy from maintain due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 32-7/8.</p>
